  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Historical Monuments Preservation Program (CCLIP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Puesta en Valor del Patrimonio (CCLIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollar e implantar mecanismo de gestin del sector patrimonial que asegure la sostenibilidad del sector as como desarrollar actividades econmicas que generen oportunidades para las poblaciones que viven en los sitios patrimoniales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the country in the development and implementation of a new management mechanism for the patrimonial sector that ensures sector sustainability as well as develop economic activities that generate opportunities for the population that live in patrimonial areas.</narrative>
  </description>
